index ea1a1a0..24f2de2 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,26 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add v1 `Files.AddFile`, which uploads a file to `POST /files` from a file
+  name and an `io.Reader`, building the multipart body itself, mirroring
+  `CallLogs.AddRecording`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Requests with seekable bodies (for example `*os.File` uploads or
+  SDK-assembled multipart bodies) are now retried on 429/502/503/504.
+  Previously only in-memory buffer and string bodies carried a `GetBody`, so
+  file uploads surfaced the first rate-limit error instead of retrying.
+- Seekable upload bodies are shielded from the transport's per-attempt
+  `Close`, so an open file is no longer closed before a retry re-reads it.
+  Callers keep ownership of the sources they pass and close them when the
+  call returns.
+- SDK-assembled multipart bodies now wrap seekable sources (such as an
+  `os.Open` file) without buffering the file content in memory; retried
+  attempts re-read the source from disk.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
